   "description": "The timbres behind today's tech house, rebuilt as a sample pack. Every sound in Hit Stars was synthesized in Monet (SignalGen's own synth) from the presets the SignalGen engine uses on its best tracks — basses, leads, keys, stabs, plucks and pads. No third-party samples, no factory presets. Each sound comes four ways: a 4-bar loop (128 BPM, key in the file name), the MIDI clip of that loop, a tuned one shot and the Monet preset itself — drop the loop, replay the line with your own notes, or open the patch and tweak it. Every element is mastered.",
